  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equivalent reaction can be written as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math></p><p>So, mass number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math>mass number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>182</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>174</mn></math></p><p>Atomic number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math>atomic number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>74</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>71</mn></math></p><p>The reaction is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>D</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>74</mn><mn>182</mn></mmultiscripts><munder><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></munder><mmultiscripts><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>72</mn><mn>178</mn></mmultiscripts><munder><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></munder><mmultiscripts><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>73</mn><mn>178</mn></mmultiscripts><munder><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></munder><mmultiscripts><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>71</mn><mn>174</mn></mmultiscripts><munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></munder><mmultiscripts><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>71</mn><mn>174</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p>",
